this is evan langer reading for writer  kevin kenizevek mario golf super rush  will be available later this month on  nintendo switch  but before launch we got a chance to see  more of the game during a virtual  preview event and in this video we'll be  discussing our hands-off impressions  if you like this video and want to see  more mario golf super rush coverage  including our review then consider  subscribing to gamespot  nice huh nearly three years to date  after mario and friends hit the courts  in mario tennis aces the plumber is  returning in mario golf super rush the  latest entry in nintendo's long-running  sports series  as it did with the aforementioned aces  developer camelot has taken the familiar  mario golf gameplay and livened it up  with more action  making super rush an even snappier take  on the sport than previous installments  the headlining new addition in this  installment is speedgolf a hectic new  mode in which you and three other  golfers compete to sink the ball  the fastest unlike during a standard  round of golf each player takes their  shots simultaneously and you must  manually run to your ball after you've  hit it making this mode a mad dash to  the green  the ultimate aim of speed golf is to  clear every hole in the fastest time  each shot you take adds 30 seconds to  your timer which is where precision  comes into play  you can feasibly sync your ball before  the other players by hitting it as  quickly as possible but if you take too  many shots you'll end up with a slower  overall time so you'll need to strike a  balance between speed  and careful play to prevail on route to  your ball you'll be able to unleash a  special dash which will knock down any  opponents you barrel over costing them  coins and more precisely  time each of the game's 16 characters  boasts their own signature special dash  yoshi for instance roll atop a giant egg  when a special dash is activated  as in previous games every character  also has their own special shots which  can be employed to interrupt other  players  these elements come together to make  speed golf a clever frenetic take on the  sport and it looks like it'll be the  highlight of the package  this isn't the only major change camelot  has implemented however the studio has  also tweaked other aspects of the  gameplay to improve the overall  experience  in the standard golf mode you'll now be  able to choose between take turns  and an all at once option for  multiplayer sessions the former is the  more traditional way to play with each  player alternating turns while the  ladder lets everyone tee off  simultaneously  the object is still to sink the ball in  the fewest shots possible so your time  won't affect your score as it does in  speed golf but this option looks like  it'll make rounds much  faster each mode also gives you the  option to play 3 6  9 or the full 18 holes of a course and  the game features an extensive glossary  explaining golf terminology and controls  for newer players  the other major addition in mario golf  super rush is golf adventure  a light rpg-like story mode in which you  guide your me characters on a journey to  become a pro golfer  as part of your adventure you'll need to  talk to coaches around the various clubs  you visit to learn more about different  golfing techniques and complete lessons  as you progress your meat will level up  which in turn will improve your stats  coins you earn during your adventure can  also be used to purchase new outfits and  other gear  like pieces of equipment and rpgs the  gear will improve your stats when  equipped and you'll also be able to use  your powered up me in other modes  much like the adventure mode in mario  tennis aces golf adventure serves as a  good way to acclimate players to the  game's controls and the general rules of  golf  but there's also a story running through  the mode revolving around wario and  waluigi search for a treasure  while pursuing the pair you'll also  encounter several boss battles  the first pits you against a knight that  launches lightning bolts you'll need to  avoid and deflect the knight's attacks  with golf swings to topple the boss  between the frantic new speed golf mode  and the other tweaks camelot has made  mario golf super rush is shaping up to  be another enjoyable entry in the  golfing series  thanks for watching if you like this  video then consider clicking the like  button and let us know in the comments  what future mario golf super rush videos  you'd like to see  for all things mario stay tuned to game  [Music]  spot  you
 

